      "title": "camel: create and populate the stats table only once",
      "message": "camel: create and populate the stats table only once\n\nUse the new stat_tap_find_table function during init to check if our\nstatistics table already exists.\n\nIf so, we can safely assume that its rows have already beend initialized.\nAll we have to do is clear the data that was collected by the tap.\n",
      "author_name": "Martin Kaiser",
      "author_email": "wireshark@kaiser.cx",
      "authored_date": "2021-02-06T15:14:48.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
